# Paths clang-format must never touch — see docs/BUILD_GUIDE.md Part 13.5.
#
# CI's format-check job runs `find firmware host \( -name "*.cpp" -o -name "*.h" \)` over a clean
# checkout, where these directories do not exist. Locally they do, and they contain third-party
# sources (the STM32 Arduino core, STM32duino FreeRTOS, Adafruit and TinyGPSPlus libraries) that
# must be left exactly as upstream ships them. Without this file, running the same command locally
# rewrites vendored code inside the build tree.
firmware/sensor_actuator_hub/.pio/*
host/build/*
host/test/unit/build/*
build/*
